{"id":"469819","name":"油条丝瓜汤","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/469819/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"油条","amount":"1根"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"荷包蛋","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"早餐喝糁剩的油条1根。","img":"images/469819/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"原料图：丝瓜2根刮皮切片，火腿切丁，荷包蛋切条。","img":"images/469819/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中倒油。","img":"images/469819/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油热倒葱花爆香。","img":"images/469819/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入丝瓜翻炒。","img":"images/469819/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入火腿丁继续翻炒。","img":"images/469819/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入适量水烧开，放入洗好的粉条和荷包蛋丝。","img":"images/469819/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开后加盐。","img":"images/469819/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"出锅前放入油条。","img":"images/469819/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"营养丰富的油条丝瓜汤做好了。","img":"images/469819/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"丝瓜汤吸收了油条的香味，油条浸润了丝瓜的清爽，是夏季必备的美食。","img":"images/469819/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}